      "customfield_10231": {
        "value": {
          "type": "doc",
          "version": 1,
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "Component configuration",
                  "marks": [
                    {
                      "type": "strong"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ],
              "attrs": {
                "localId": "3e3f405003d4"
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "orderedList",
              "attrs": {
                "order": 1,
                "localId": "06fa0adf6d57"
              },
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "listItem",
                  "attrs": {
                    "localId": "6d9e09ea9805"
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "Given the component is rendered with showDescription=true, when the drawer opens, then a contextual description is displayed beneath the drawer header; when false, no description is rendered."
                        }
                      ],
                      "attrs": {
                        "localId": "72e237ee7cf2"
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "listItem",
                  "attrs": {
                    "localId": "16dbf67092a8"
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "Given the component is rendered with showLanguageSelector=true, when the drawer opens, then a Language section with radio options is rendered below the country list; when false, no Language section is rendered."
                        }
                      ],
                      "attrs": {
                        "localId": "9b222918fd07"
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "listItem",
                  "attrs": {
                    "localId": "3dff7c7ca62c"
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "Given the component is rendered with variant=\"country-currency-selector\", when the drawer opens, then the main content area renders the full country list grouped by region with currency codes alongside each country."
                        }
                      ],
                      "attrs": {
                        "localId": "2689cbc24d79"
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "country-selector-dropdown atom (region groups)",
                  "marks": [
                    {
                      "type": "strong"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ],
              "attrs": {
                "localId": "22f13579d2a9"
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "orderedList",
              "attrs": {
                "order": 1,
                "localId": "05a44e00dce0"
              },
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "listItem",
                  "attrs": {
                    "localId": "70747eab81a6"
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "Given a region group is rendered, when in the collapsed state, then only the region label and chevron are visible and no country rows are shown beneath it."
                        }
                      ],
                      "attrs": {
                        "localId": "27bbacb21aee"
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "listItem",
                  "attrs": {
                    "localId": "9591e1fed441"
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "Given a region group header is clicked or tapped, when toggled to expanded, then country rows appear beneath the header, each showing a flag icon, country name, and right-aligned currency code."
                        }
                      ],
                      "attrs": {
                        "localId": "ba201eb38069"
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "listItem",
                  "attrs": {
                    "localId": "128a1da9908f"
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "Given the drawer opens, when the shopper's current country falls within a region group, then that group renders in the expanded state with the current country's radio pre-selected."
                        }
                      ],
                      "attrs": {
                        "localId": "445851018246"
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "Drawer shell and interaction",
                  "marks": [
                    {
                      "type": "strong"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ],
              "attrs": {
                "localId": "b16f6527b646"
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "orderedList",
              "attrs": {
                "order": 1,
                "localId": "9694e6f1a46a"
              },
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "listItem",
                  "attrs": {
                    "localId": "5e5158263740"
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "Given the component is rendered, when it opens, then it slides in from the right on desktop and full-width on mobile leaving a small space open at the bottom, with a dark overlay backdrop."
                        }
                      ],
                      "attrs": {
                        "localId": "406f5c15eccb"
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "listItem",
                  "attrs": {
                    "localId": "5cf63c1709f9"
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "Given the drawer is open, when the shopper scrolls the country list, then the drawer header and the Confirm footer remain sticky and the country list scrolls independently."
                        }
                      ],
                      "attrs": {
                        "localId": "30e9b4a88649"
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "listItem",
                  "attrs": {
                    "localId": "f9368ca432fd"
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "Given the shopper selects a country and presses the Apply CTA, when confirmed, then onConfirm(country, locale) fires with the selected values and the consuming page handles the redirect."
                        }
                      ],
                      "attrs": {
                        "localId": "2e6600e6e095"
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "listItem",
                  "attrs": {
                    "localId": "84af071a39a4"
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "Given the drawer is open, when the shopper presses the close (x) icon or the backdrop, then the drawer closes without firing the callback and the prior selection is retained."
                        }
                      ],
                      "attrs": {
                        "localId": "08ec5f73457d"
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "accessibility",
                  "marks": [
                    {
                      "type": "strong"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ],
              "attrs": {
                "localId": "0e4822c6f72c"
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "orderedList",
              "attrs": {
                "order": 1,
                "localId": "1b8889675024"
              },
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "listItem",
                  "attrs": {
                    "localId": "a94870569ff8"
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "Given the component is rendered, when a keyboard user navigates, then focus is trapped within the open drawer, radio buttons are navigable via arrow keys, and closing the drawer returns focus to the trigger element."
                        }
                      ],
                      "attrs": {
                        "localId": "a2edb342a007"
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "listItem",
                  "attrs": {
                    "localId": "9d752ef66a2a"
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "Given the component renders on desktop, when viewed on mobile, then the drawer is full-width and all interactive elements meet minimum touch target size per the Design System spec."
                        }
                      ],
                      "attrs": {
                        "localId": "d81c7ca76f77"
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "listItem",
                  "attrs": {
                    "localId": "03c67dadc5a3"
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "Given the component is rendered, when a screen reader user interacts with the drawer, then the drawer is announced as a dialog with an accessible name, all interactive elements have descriptive labels, the accordion region groups expose expanded/collapsed state via aria-expanded, and the search field (if rendered) has an accessible label."
                        }
                      ],
                      "attrs": {
                        "localId": "b866bc4d436c"
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      }
